{"38f386ce-f2dc-4f2b-99f9-522eab56078d":{"id":"38f386ce-f2dc-4f2b-99f9-522eab56078d","title":"Webtoon Character Na Kang Lim","altTitle":"수요웹툰의 나강림","description":"Na Kang Lim, a high school student who enjoys reading webtoons, experiences a strange event one day when the female lead from his favorite webtoon appears before him. Even more surprising, the same incidents that put her in danger in the webtoon start happening in real life. The problem is, there's no protagonist in the real world to save her! Ultimately, Na Kang Lim takes on the role of the protagonist, looping through time to save her.","year":2021,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"172","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Comedy","Superhero","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/38f386ce-f2dc-4f2b-99f9-522eab56078d/bb45c8ed-521d-47a4-b780-cfc72b356228.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["vi","en","pt-br","hu","id","ar"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":9.46,"follows":39543,"listAt":"2026-10-23T06:40:29.044Z","chapters":[{"id":"7427b1f0-4e0c-4b56-ac6d-dd1de302ef64","number":"172.5","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":2,"createdAt":"2025-04-01T15:33:32+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:27:42.482Z"},"c7311cec-9b0f-42f3-8afe-a06cb5b70229":{"id":"c7311cec-9b0f-42f3-8afe-a06cb5b70229","title":"Isekai de Skill wo Kaitai Shitara Cheat na Yome ga Zoushoku Shimashita - Gainen Kousa no Structure","altTitle":"Being Able to Edit Skills in Another World I Gained OP Waifus","description":"When an entire bus of people was summoned to another world, Souma Nagi doesn't go along with the idea of being a Hero like the rest. Thus he leaves the palace and starts his life in another world with his ability to restructure skills. This is the first time I've ever been to a game where I've been able to do that & the first time I've ever seen a story about a girl who is a slave, a wife, and a cheat!","year":2017,"status":